<title>USA: Healthsource Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Healthsource Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOOKSETT, N.H. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.35   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		  22,601   profit	15,855</p>
<p> Revs		     438,337		  343,635</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,795		   65,167</p>
<p>				  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.08   profit	 $0.81</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,940   profit	56,271</p>
<p> Revs		   1,713,963		1,166,697</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,725		   64,195</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 earnings include non-recurring charge of $0.40/share in Q4 and $0.53/share in year from costs related to enhancement of provider arrangements and restructuring.</p>
<p>Cigna Corp has agreed to acquire Healthsource in a deal worth $1.7 billion.</p>
